&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Time Series can be described as a collection of sequential values at a point in time. As this is an ordered series (ordered by tiem), the sequence of which is thus important and pertinent to the discussion.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
